  "features": [
    "adds an Assist project mode for Responsible AI Assistance",
    "prepares AI requests from explicitly selected canonical Workspace Objects",
    "shows the grounding basis, provenance availability, and selected object count before an AI request leaves Workspace",
    "copies or exports grounded prompt/request packages without automatic remote submission",
    "supports an explicit same-origin Research Librarian handoff using a browser-session AI request package",
    "stores pasted or adapter-returned AI responses locally for review",
    "requires explicit user acceptance before an AI response can become a Workspace Document",
    "tags accepted output ai-assisted and human-accepted and records visible derived-from lineage to cited grounding objects",
    "lets users reject AI responses without mutating canonical evidence or decisions",
    "exports portable AI request and response JSON packages",
    "advances project export/import to schema 11.0 and retains v10.0 import compatibility",
    "retains the canonical Knowledge Library route /knowledge-libraries/",
    "ships a provider-neutral same-origin AI return helper for compatible Sustainable Catalyst tools",
    "accepts structured AI responses through a local response inbox or same-origin postMessage only after matching the originating local project and request",
    "filters returned citation object IDs to the objects explicitly selected as the request grounding basis"
  ],
